#: src/main.rs:20 src/ui/window.rs:75 src/ui/window.rs:829
msgid "MomentStays"
msgstr "留刻"

#: src/model/claims.rs:14
msgid "Motion photos; local static HDR; HONOR/Huawei JPEG bursts. Google/Samsung bursts are experimental. Private HDR supports only specific profiles."
msgstr "实况；本地静态 HDR；荣耀/华为 JPEG 连拍。Google/三星连拍为实验支持。私有 HDR 仅部分配置。"

#: src/model/claims.rs:19
msgid "; local static HDR supports verified types only; burst conversion is unsupported."
msgstr "；静态 HDR 仅本地已支持类型；不支持连拍转换。"

#: src/model/claims.rs:21
msgid "Only the verified routes below are supported. Available Live Photo, HDR, and burst actions depend on inspection and preview. Private HDR is experimental and off by default. Arbitrary Android-to-Android transfers are unsupported."
msgstr "仅支持下列已验证路线。实况、HDR、连拍的实际可执行范围以扫描和预览为准；私有 HDR 为实验功能，默认关闭，不支持任意安卓互转。"

#: src/model/claims.rs:24
msgid "Conversion changes the format or metadata of output copies. Keep source photos archived and backed up. Source files remain read-only."
msgstr "转换会修改输出副本的格式或元数据；建议保留原图存档备份。源文件保持只读。"

#: src/model/claims.rs:27
msgid "This build has no Linux codec backend: static HDR checks, burst checks and image re-encoding are unavailable."
msgstr "此版本未包含 Linux 编解码后端：无法进行静态 HDR 检查、连拍检查和图像重新编码。"

