msgid "Stopping"
msgstr "停止中"

#: src/model/flow.rs:283
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

#: src/model/flow.rs:293
msgid "Preview Export"
msgstr "预览导出"

#: src/model/flow.rs:296
msgid "Choose Output Location…"
msgstr "选择输出位置…"

#: src/model/flow.rs:298
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Export {count} Unchanged Photos"
msgstr "原样导出 {count} 张"

#: src/model/flow.rs:300
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Run on {count} Photos"
msgstr "开始执行 {count} 张"

#: src/model/flow.rs:303
msgid "Back to Import Photos"
msgstr "返回导入照片"

#: src/model/flow.rs:318
msgid "Waiting for a safe stop"
msgstr "等待安全停止"

#: src/model/flow.rs:320
msgid "The task is frozen. Earlier steps can be browsed read-only"
msgstr "任务已冻结，可只读浏览前面的步骤"

#: src/model/flow.rs:326
msgid "0 selected. Select photos to continue"
msgstr "已选 0 张，请重新勾选照片"

#: src/model/flow.rs:331
msgid "Direction selected. Import photos next"
msgstr "方向已选，下一步导入照片"

#: src/model/flow.rs:333
msgid "Choose a direction card on the left"
msgstr "请选择左侧的方向卡片"

#: src/model/flow.rs:338
msgid "Recognizing sources; please wait"
msgstr "正在识别来源，请稍候"

#: src/model/flow.rs:340
msgid "Add photos, then select this run's scope"
msgstr "添加照片后选择本轮范围"

#: src/model/flow.rs:343
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This run: {count} photos. Filtering does not change selection"
msgstr "本轮 {count} 张，筛选不改变选择"

#: src/model/flow.rs:350
msgid "Fill missing dates only; keep the original photo format"
msgstr "仅补缺照片时间；原照片格式保持不变"

#: src/model/flow.rs:352
msgid "Choose this run's features here; change direction in step 1"
msgstr "只选择本轮处理特性，转换方向在第一步更改"

#: src/model/flow.rs:357
msgid "Choose this run's output location"
msgstr "请选择本轮输出位置"

#: src/model/flow.rs:361 src/ui/run.rs:76
msgid "Choose an unchanged-export folder"
msgstr "请选择原样导出目录"

#: src/model/flow.rs:363
msgid "Run the ready scope. Estimates do not guarantee success"
msgstr "按本轮就绪范围执行，预估不代表实际成功"

#: src/model/flow.rs:366
msgid "Keep this run's results and return to photos"
msgstr "保留本轮结果，可返回查看照片"

#: src/model/plan.rs:146
msgid "Only some members are selected. Select the whole group or explicitly export independent photos"
msgstr "只选择了部分成员；请选择全组，或显式按独立照片导出"

#: src/model/plan.rs:159
msgid "Select a representative frame"
msgstr "请选择代表帧"

#: src/model/plan.rs:239
msgid "The selected Live Photo auxiliary-output options cannot currently be combined with static HDR. Adjust those options or process separately"
msgstr "本轮实况附加输出选项与静态 HDR 的组合尚未支持；请调整实况选项或分批处理"

#: src/model/plan.rs:252
msgid "Target JPEG requires HDR reconstruction. HDR cannot be safely preserved while its action is off; change the format or selected features"
msgstr "目标 JPEG 需要 HDR 重建，未选择 HDR 时不能安全保留；请调整格式或特性"

#: src/model/plan.rs:257
msgid "HDR-only processing cannot safely preserve the original burst container yet. Enable burst conversion or export unchanged resources"
msgstr "仅 HDR 尚不能安全保留原连拍封装；请启用连拍或原样输出"

#: src/model/plan.rs:259
msgid "Burst conversion is not selected; original burst resources are preserved"
msgstr "未选择连拍转换；原连拍资源保持不变"

#: src/model/plan.rs:265
msgid "HDR-only processing cannot safely preserve this motion container yet. Enable Live Photo conversion or export unchanged resources"
msgstr "仅 HDR 尚不能安全保留此原动态封装；请启用实况或原样输出"

#: src/model/plan.rs:267
msgid "Live Photo conversion is not selected; original motion resources are preserved"
msgstr "未选择实况转换；原动态资源保持不变"

#: src/model/plan.rs:272
msgid "HDR conversion is not selected; original HDR resources are preserved"
msgstr "未选择 HDR 转换；原 HDR 资源保持不变"

#: src/model/plan.rs:280
msgid "A custom cover cannot preserve unselected HDR. Restore the original cover or change the selected features"
msgstr "自选封面不能保留未选择转换的 HDR；请恢复原封面或调整特性"

#: src/model/plan.rs:343
msgid "Will not convert: "
msgstr "不会转换："

#: src/model/plan.rs:348
msgid "Partly executable: HDR cannot be converted"
msgstr "部分可执行：HDR 不可转换"

#: src/model/plan.rs:350
msgid "May fail; execution-time verification required"
msgstr "可能失败，需执行校验"

#: src/model/plan.rs:356
msgid "Expected to Run"
msgstr "预计可执行"

#: src/model/plan.rs:359
msgid "Date already present; no repair needed"
msgstr "已有时间，无需补缺"

#: src/model/plan.rs:362
msgid "Planned unchanged export"
msgstr "预计原样输出"

#: src/model/plan.rs:364 src/ui/inspector.rs:234 src/ui/queue.rs:744
msgid "Not converted in this run"
msgstr "本轮不转换"

#: src/model/plan.rs:371
msgid "Plan to export complete original resources; required resources still need readability checks."
msgstr "预计按完整原资源输出；仍需检查必要资源是否可读。"

#: src/model/plan.rs:373
msgid "No converted output will be generated. See the plan for the reason."
msgstr "不生成转换成片；原因见本次计划。"

#: src/model/plan.rs:377
msgid "Planned output: date-repaired still copy in the original format"
msgstr "预计输出：补缺时间的静态照片副本，保持原格式"

#: src/model/plan.rs:379
msgid "Planned output: target motion format and required paired resources"
msgstr "预计输出：目标动态格式与必要配对资源"

#: src/model/plan.rs:381
msgid "Planned output: selected burst members and group resources"
msgstr "预计输出：所选连拍成员与组资源"

#: src/model/plan.rs:383
msgid "Planned output: one static HDR image, without Live Photo video"
msgstr "预计输出：静态 HDR 单图，不生成实况视频"

#: src/model/plan.rs:402
msgid "Export selected photos independently without writing burst markers"
msgstr "原样输出所选独立照片，不写连拍标记"

#: src/model/plan.rs:404
msgid "Convert burst markers; preserve existing indices and all selected frames. Missing frames are allowed; the original total is not inferred"
msgstr "连拍标记转换 · 保留现有原序号与全部所选帧；允许缺帧，不猜原总数"

#: src/model/plan.rs:410
msgid "PhotoTime fills only missing capture dates in output copies, preserving image encoding and other features. Without a reliable date or explicit synthetic-time option, no capture date is written."
msgstr "PhotoTime：只补全输出副本的缺失拍摄时间，保留原编码与其他特性；没有可靠日期且未选合成排序时间时不写拍摄时间。"

#: src/model/plan.rs:417
msgid "Capture-date rewriting cannot safely rebuild this target motion container yet. Disable date repair or choose another route; it will not be silently flattened into a still image."
msgstr "时间写入尚不支持当前目标动态容器的安全重封装；请关闭补缺选项或更改路线，不会静默拆为静态图。"

#: src/model/plan.rs:421
msgid "Cannot convert with the current settings. Unchanged export may be available; target compatibility is not guaranteed"
msgstr "当前不能转换；可选择原样导出，不承诺目标兼容"

#: src/model/plan.rs:427
msgid "Static HDR: process as one image, without video, cover time, or Live Photo pairing"
msgstr "静态 HDR：独立单图处理；没有视频、封面或实况配对"

#: src/model/plan.rs:434
msgid "Convert motion photos into Apple paired resources"
msgstr "实况转换为 Apple 配对资源"

#: src/model/plan.rs:436
msgid "Convert Live Photos into the target motion format"
msgstr "实况转换为目标动态格式"

#: src/model/plan.rs:439
msgid "Preserve motion, audio, and a trusted cover"
msgstr "保留动态、声音与可信封面"

#: src/model/plan.rs:443
msgid "HDR follows available capabilities. Private HDR conversion is experimental; unsupported HDR is reported and ignored without blocking other supported actions"
msgstr "HDR 按实际能力处理；私有 HDR 转换属实验性尝试，无法处理时记录忽略原因，不阻断其他已支持步骤"

#: src/model/plan.rs:445
msgid "HDR follows the standard compatibility path. Private HDR conversion is off or does not apply to this output"
msgstr "HDR 按标准兼容路径处理；私有 HDR 实验转换未启用或不适用于当前输出"

#: src/model/plan.rs:453
msgid "The custom high-resolution cover is JPEG and does not preserve the original cover's HDR"
msgstr "自选高清封面为 JPEG，不保留原封面的 HDR"

#: src/ui/burst.rs:30
msgid "Trusted HONOR JPEG → Apple only. Missing frames are allowed; existing frame indices are preserved. No frames or video are synthesized. Filenames cannot establish the camera's original total; only currently available members are checked."
msgstr "仅支持可信荣耀 JPEG → Apple。允许缺帧，保留现有成员的原始帧序号，不补帧、不合成视频。文件名不能证明相机原始总帧数；这里只核对当前来源中可见的成员。"

#: src/ui/burst.rs:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{label} · {frames} frames · {selected} selected"
msgstr "{label} · {frames} 帧 · 已选 {selected} 帧"

#: src/ui/burst.rs:96 src/ui/burst.rs:103
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Frame {index}"
msgstr "第 {index} 帧"

#: src/ui/burst.rs:99
msgid "Original COVER"
msgstr "原始 COVER"

#: src/ui/burst.rs:113 src/ui/queue.rs:827
msgid "Select this photo"
msgstr "勾选此照片"

#: src/ui/burst.rs:127
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Set frame {index} as representative"
msgstr "将第 {index} 帧设为代表帧"

#: src/ui/burst.rs:149
msgid "Export selected photos independently (no burst markers)"
msgstr "按所选独立照片导出（不写连拍标记）"

#: src/ui/burst.rs:190
msgid "Burst Conversion Plan"
msgstr "连拍迁移计划"

#: src/ui/burst.rs:195 src/ui/cover.rs:72
msgid "Done"
msgstr "完成"

#: src/ui/burst.rs:197
msgid "Save selection and return to workspace"
msgstr "保存选择并返回工作台"

#: src/ui/cover.rs:67
msgid "Choose Cover"
msgstr "选择封面"

#: src/ui/cover.rs:86
msgid "Reading high-resolution cover…"
msgstr "正在读取高清封面…"

#: src/ui/cover.rs:119 src/ui/cover.rs:126
msgid "No other high-resolution covers found"
msgstr "未找到其他高清封面"

#: src/ui/cover.rs:145
msgid "Source cover"
msgstr "源封面"

#: src/ui/cover.rs:161
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cover {seconds} s"
msgstr "封面 {seconds} 秒"

#: src/ui/cover.rs:204
msgid "Changing the cover does not affect the motion video. New covers are JPEG and do not preserve the original cover's HDR."
msgstr "更换封面不影响动态视频。新封面为 JPEG，不保留原封面的 HDR。"

