msgstr "仅 Google 实况 JPEG → 荣耀；不支持 HEIC、相册来源或连拍。"

#: src/ui/direction.rs:51
msgid "Recognized HONOR Motion Photo JPEG → Google only. HEIC, Photos library sources, and bursts are unsupported."
msgstr "仅已识别荣耀实况 JPEG → Google；不支持 HEIC、相册来源或连拍。"

